resetValues [SimTalk]
Resets the collected values for the Category > Histogram and the Category > Plotter of the Chart
designated by <Path>.
Remarks
resetValues deletes the existing data and starts collecting data anew.
You can, for example, use it to record a weekly histogram or to suppress data collected during the ramp-up
phase.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.resetValues
Example
MyChart.resetValues
See also
Copy to Clipboard
Category [drop-down list]
resetValues [SimTalk]
Plant Simulation Help 11-4743
